    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but if it's just \"heightened awareness\", why does it feel so much like a response? like the universe is reacting to me specifically? \n\nit's not just about seeing stuff, it's the timing. it's like i'm tapping into a different layer of reality where my thoughts and external events are connected. if it were just confirmation bias, it wouldn't feel this intentional. i feel like i've actually mastered a way to use synchronicity to navigate my life. does that make any sense at all, or am i just totally off base?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
